<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower Friday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index fell 4.88 to 635.51.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.11.</p>
<p>Declines beat advances, 331 to 186.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,163,570 compared with 22,044,040 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
